; routerespawn.eval - saving a monster type while its monster's route is being
; laid, or while its inspector or the monster dialog is open (code-review C232).
; Judged by tools/EditorTest.py phase 23, which runs it WINDOWED: the fault was
; in the drawing - the reopened inspector drew a preview whose mesh the save
; had freed. Each line after a save is a frame drawn.
;
;   --- route ---   A (the skel_warrior at 23,9) gets a route; `typeset` saves
;                   its kind, which respawns every monster with a new id: the
;                   route has ended with A's old id, and Enter reopens nothing.
;   --- open ---    the respawned warrior's inspector open, then a save of its
;                   kind: the save closes it first.
;   --- dialog ---  the monster dialog open on the kind, then a save: closed.
;
; The field saved is hp, at the value it already has.

logecho on
reset
timescale 0
echo --- route ---
editor inspect 23 9
editor inspector
editor inspector editroute
editor route 23 11
editor route
typeset monsters skel_warrior hp 22
editor route
editor route key enter
editor inspector
editor route
editor route
echo --- open ---
editor inspect 23 9
editor inspector
typeset monsters skel_warrior hp 22
editor inspector
editor inspector
editor inspector
echo --- dialog ---
monsterdialog skel_warrior
typeset monsters skel_warrior hp 22
monsterdialog
monsterdialog
echo --- end ---
